		<dc:description><p>On a dark and stormy night...</p> <p><i>The Castle of Wolfenbach</i> was listed as one of the reccomended "horrid novels" in <a href="https://standardebooks.org/ebooks/jane-austen">Jane Austen</a>'s <a href="https://standardebooks.org/ebooks/jane-austen/northanger-abbey"><i>Northanger Abbey</i></a></p> </dc:description>
